  "releaseNotes": "New in this release:\n      - Add support for .NET 11\n      - Breaking change: the InvalidCommandParameterException constructors now throw ArgumentNullException for a null expected type or actual type, and the (Type, Exception) constructor for a null inner exception\n      - Assembly version is now 11.0.0.0: .NET Framework apps may need binding redirects, as with every major release",
